    "name": "📌 Black Forest Labs API (FLUX)",
    "description": "### About Black Forest Labs\n\n\"Black Forest Labs is building visual intelligence: models that understand, reason, and act in the world.\"\n\nBlack Forest Labs builds the FLUX image and video models and serves them through its own API. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Image & video**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- Black Forest Labs Account: [https://bfl.ai/](https://bfl.ai/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `black_forest_labs_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:black_forest_labs_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://docs.bfl.ml/flux_3/flux3_image_overview](https://docs.bfl.ml/flux_3/flux3_image_overview)\n    \n- Models: [https://docs.bfl.ml/flux_3/flux3_overview](https://docs.bfl.ml/flux_3/flux3_overview)\n\n### Notes\n\nGeneration is asynchronous: send a request, then **Results / Get result** polls `temp.polling_url` until `status` is `Ready`.",
